      "m_name": "\u0000YSeasonsDataManager\u0000\u000e\u0000\u0000\u0000PVE_S3E3_Name\u0000\b\u0000\u0000\u0000Culling",
      "m_descShort": "\u0000YSeasonsDataManager\u0000\u0014\u0000\u0000\u0000PVE_S3E3_Desc_Short\u0000\u001a\u0000\u0000\u0000Battleship Down - Culling",
      "m_descLong": "\u0000YSeasonsDataManager\u0000\u0013\u0000\u0000\u0000PVE_S3E3_Desc_Long\u0000\u001d\u0001\u0000\u0000The Bun Bun Cult brought more to the field than house Oberon planned for, and now their fleet is tangled fighting a new wave of raider ships in orbit. On Callisto's surface, cultist ships prepare to raze the corp's installations and supporting colony. Destroy every last enemy vessel!",
