      "m_descLong": "\u0000YSeasonsDataManager\u0000\u0013\u0000\u0000\u0000PVE_S3E4_Desc_Long\u0000\u00a1\u0000\u0000\u0000With the battle for Callisto won and the Cult's fleets all but destroyed, the hunt has begun for the cult's scattered remnants, and more importantly, for their ",
