    "PVE_S1E4": {
      "m_name": "\u0000YSeasonsDataManager\u0000\u000e\u0000\u0000\u0000PVE_S1E4_Name\u0000\u0012\u0000\u0000\u0000Goodwill Expenses",
      "m_descShort": "\u0000YSeasonsDataManager\u0000\u0014\u0000\u0000\u0000PVE_S1E4_Desc_Short\u0000(\u0000\u0000\u0000Miner Inconvenience - Goodwill Expenses",
      "m_descLong": "\u0000YSeasonsDataManager\u0000\u0013\u0000\u0000\u0000PVE_S1E4_Desc_Long\u0000z\u0001\u0000\u0000The evacuation of Io is nearly complete, but a mining complex has suffered a collapse, trapping scores of workers underground. With Jupiter Arms nowhere to be seen and the Jovian Raiders still on the offensive, the Miners Union is setting up a rescue operation lead by the captain of the Deliverance. Escort the hauler through hostile territory and evacuate the trapped miners!",
